+// ── CPS-2 WIDE v1 (Vampire Saved project) ──
+// vsavj with the EXTENDED QSOUND REGION: 8MB -> 16MB, as four uniform 4MB
+// members. Pure descriptor change — FBNeo derives every region size from
+// this table (CpsGetROMs sums nCpsQSamLen) and the QSound reader masks with
+// `rom_mask = nCpsQSamLen - 1` (qs_c.cpp), so no code change is needed, and
+// nothing here touches the stock vsav/vsavj entries.
+// The length MUST stay a power of two or that mask is wrong: 8->16MB is
+// legal, 8->12MB is not.
